// expect-exit: 0
mod:escape_root_lost_ok;
// WHAT THE ESCAPE WALK'S ROOT CHECKS LEAVE LEGAL (landing 177d2b4, row 4), each cell a right program, its exit the same at -O0, -O2 and
// under the freed-heap detector: one under the hops' end on the direct assignment (`asgn_62`, `asgn_63`) and on a call's result (`rc63`,
// `rci63`); a `for` and a lending `pick` over a place 64 hops deep that carry nothing (`rf64`, `rpk64`: the walk's end isn't reached); a
// `$$i` claim on alias's roads at 64 steps (`gcd64`, `gcr64`); a view of a place 62 steps deep, read (`gv62_ok`); a chain of 64 lending
// picks, read (`vw64_ok`); and beta's direct assignment read inside its block (`asu1c`, `asa1c`, `asr1c`). The faces are in
// `escape_root_lost.npk`.
